# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Format: from to status

# www to non-www (UK domain)
https://www.emergencytradesmen.net/* https://emergencytradesmen.net/:splat 301!

# www to non-www (US domain)
https://www.emergencycontractors.net/* https://emergencycontractors.net/:splat 301!

# Region-correct sitemap on the US domain. The default /sitemap.xml file is the
# UK sitemap index; on emergencycontractors.net we rewrite to the US index so
# crawlers never see UK URLs from a US origin.
https://emergencycontractors.net/sitemap.xml /sitemap-us.xml 200
https://www.emergencycontractors.net/sitemap.xml /sitemap-us.xml 200

# SPA fallback — all routes serve index.html
/* /index.html 200
